<title>USA: TENNIS-AMERICA'S RED CLAY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AMERICA'S RED CLAY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL SPRINGS, Florida 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$245,000 America's Red Clay Tennis Championship on Sunday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>4-Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) beat 1-Jonas Bjorkman</p>
<p>(Sweden) 6-0 2-6 7-5</p>
